id: style-and-greed
name: Style and Greed
talentCategory: racial
race: heran
prerequisites: Herans
description: >
  You take everything you can get your greedy hands on, and you make sure you look good doing it.
text: >
  Style and Greed: You take everything you can get your greedy hands on, and you make sure you look good doing it.
  –Prerequisites: Herans
  (1)-[Passive]: Increase your Racial Life Modifier by 2.
  (2)-[Triggered]: If you hit an Opponent with an Attacking Maneuver, you may reduce the Break Value of your Top Layer of Apparel by 1 to gain a stack of Greed.
  (3)-[Triggered, 1/Encounter]: If any piece of your Apparel is destroyed, regain Life and Ki Points equal to 1/2 of your Surgency.

---

[passive]
# (1)
racialLifeModifier += 2;
# (2) An Opponent hit: asked as it lands - the Top Layer's Break Value 1 lower, a stack of Greed (Greed of the Hera's Resource;
# chat.mjs styleGreed).
allow styleGreed.greed;
# (3) A piece of yours broken: half your Surgency in Life and Ki Points, once an Encounter (dbu-ttrpg.mjs, as it breaks).
allow styleGreed.heal;
